  "description": "Ha-Jin has suffered relentless torment from a stalker ever since he was outed… Pushed to both the metaphorical and physical edge, he sees no way out. Just as he’s ready to give up on life, an unexpected savior appears: an angel named Kael. But this isn’t your typical heaven-sent rescue. Kael offers a shady deal: he’ll get rid of Ha-Jin’s stalker, but in return, he wants Ha-Jin’s soul. With nothing left to lose, Ha-Jin agrees...only to learn firsthand what “touched by an angel” really means.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
